<title>NETHERLANDS: EMIS FIRST HALF NET PROFIT UP 18 PCT.</title>
<headline>EMIS FIRST HALF NET PROFIT UP 18 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Marketing Information</p>
<p>Services (EMIS) first half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.48 vs   0.41 </p>
<p>    Net profit			     1.24 vs   1.05</p>
<p>    Turnover				24.3  vs  21.3 </p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.39 vs   1.21 </p>
<p>Note - The company said in a statement it also expects a</p>
<p>growth in net profit in the second half of 1996</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
